<p></p>
<p style=3D"text-align: center;"></p>
<p>The ARKANE API generation was successful and we already have a key for u=
sing their services on Ethereum Staging. The client-id is: <strong>Creative=
-Platform.</strong></p>
<p>=E2=80=8C</p>
<p><strong>INFURA ID </strong>(on Rinkeby network): ff5a5c50d1e649bdb777f80=
813747e3d</p>
<p><strong>FORMATIC API KEYS (nicolas.guasca account):</strong></p>
<p><u>Testnet</u>: <code>pk_test_7E49F4949AFF1BA4</code></p>
<p><u>Production (localhost)</u>: <code>pk_live_C150FA21E9282CC4</code></p>
<p><strong>PORTIS API KEY (id from nicolas.guasca account)</strong>: a2b39a=
a5-90e5-43d5-9e13-2b573cfffa0a</p>
<p><strong>ALCHEMY API KEY (nicolas.guasca account)</strong>: <code>dVctn_5=
5tklzxRb2VRQsj6bUT16gh4mi</code></p>
<p>=E2=80=8C</p>
<p>Address designed for development: PENDING.</p>
<p>Chakra for UI (<a href=3D"https://chakra-ui.com/discord" class=3D"extern=
al-link" rel=3D"nofollow">discord channel</a>)</p>
<p>Polygon (for off-chain network)</p>
<p>Chainlink </p>
<p>The Graph (api=E2=80=99s integrations)</p>
<p>Aave (lending platform)</p>
<p>Aavegotchi (nft=E2=80=99s minting)</p>
<p><a href=3D"https://daohaus.club/" class=3D"external-link" rel=3D"nofollo=
w">DAO Haus</a>.</p>
<p>Nucypher (Proxy Encryption)</p>
<p>1inch (liquidity)</p>
<p><a href=3D"https://www.superfluid.finance/" class=3D"external-link" rel=
=3D"nofollow">Superfluid </a>(for streamed-value) </p>
<hr>
</div>=20
